WEBVTT

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:14.530
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:18.770
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:22.110
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:25.210
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:29.150
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:49.100
Fall back and regroup!

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:50.060
Roger!

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:51.390
l won't let you get away!

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:54.770
Jousting Flash!

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:07.850
He has potential and is quick-witted.
Not bad. However...

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:10.890
He is still very inexperienced.

00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:13.750
And the girl...

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:19.930
Compared to the movements she showed me in the air before,

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.660
she is just a bit sluggish now.

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.340
l can win! No, l <i>will</i> win!

00:01:24.670 --> 00:01:27.640
For my master who gave me power!

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:34.940
<i>To Protect Someone</i>

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:44.280
Valkyrie Skirt Stand-By Mode.

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:51.320
Whoa! That's handy!

00:01:51.530 --> 00:01:53.000
Just what l'd expect from a Valkyrie Skirt.

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:55.930
l don't really know what you mean by that,

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:57.800
but you'll be able to do all sorts of things as well

00:01:57.870 --> 00:01:59.300
if you accumulate experience.

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:08.640
Anyway, wipe off the blood.
The battle's not over yet.

00:02:09.180 --> 00:02:11.910
Thanks. Are you okay, Tokiko?

00:02:12.350 --> 00:02:14.510
Well, my right shoulder hurts a bit.

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:17.480
Tokiko?

00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:21.150
No, l'm okay. lt's no big deal.

00:02:21.630 --> 00:02:22.720
Don't be pushing yourself too far.

00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:26.890
Are you getting cocky with me?
Who do you think l am?

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:30.000
An alchemist warrior stronger than me.

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:33.000
But I'll say what l think is important, l won't hesitate to speak out.

00:02:33.740 --> 00:02:34.400
l see.

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:38.240
Okay. I'll be careful.

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:42.180
But now is the time for battle.
That hawk-type...

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:46.320
lt's obvious that it is in a different league than the other homunculi.

00:02:46.550 --> 00:02:50.220
His defense using those wings is not a technique obtained naturally.

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:55.060
l found you!

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:55.950
Here he comes!

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:58.430
One. So they have split up, huh?!

00:02:58.560 --> 00:02:59.620
Listen up, Kazuki.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:03.090
The hawk-type's defense using his wings is indeed superb.

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:05.230
However, it's not absolute!

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:09.810
After we attacked simultaneously, he used his claws, not his wings.

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:13.640
His wing defense can't completely handle a sequence of offense and defense.

00:03:14.410 --> 00:03:17.580
There's one thing to shoot for!
A high-speed successive attack!

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:21.580
After the first person becomes a decoy and elicits his wing defense,

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:24.990
the second person will deliver the blow.

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:27.180
Okay! I'll be the decoy!

00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:28.820
lf l use my lance,

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:31.060
l should be able to keep you covered until the last moment

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:34.570
with a technique combining the Slasher and Flasher!

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:36.600
Here l go!

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:46.680
Did you find Kazuki?!

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:48.470
No, he's not here.

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:50.220
He wasn't at school, either!

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:54.250
lt seems he was with Tokiko before he was supposed to meet with us.

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:55.980
What?! Her again!

00:03:56.090 --> 00:04:00.750
Well, Kazuki's disappeared several times since she showed up, so...

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:03.660
But, well, l guess we can breathe easier.

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:06.700
Darn it! I'll teach him a lesson tonight for sure!

00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:11.530
<i>Big Brother. l don't need to worry, right?</i>

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:16.140
<i>One person becomes the decoy</i> <i>and gets him to defend with his wings...</i>

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:20.240
<i>and the other person delivers</i> <i>a blow once he's thrown off balance.</i>

00:04:20.980 --> 00:04:23.310
<i>Hide behind the light</i> <i>and follow me, Tokiko!</i>

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:25.340
Valkyrie Skirt.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:34.750
<i>A beautiful bright yellow light.</i> <i>lt's like sunlight.</i>

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:40.390
<i>lt's different.</i>

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:42.700
The wind is different from the charge earlier.

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:46.640
<i>He reads the wind with his wings,</i> <i>not just his eyes.</i>

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:49.410
There's a different wind mixed in slightly.

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:55.470
l see it! The girl is behind the light!

00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:56.780
With these claws,

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:58.410
I'll take care of one person each on the right and left!

00:04:58.680 --> 00:04:59.650
lt's a failure!

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:00.840
Tokiko, run!

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:02.150
Don't stop, Kazuki!

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:08.950
l was careless letting them get above me twice!

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:10.690
But l won't lose!

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:12.690
I'll splatter your guts!

00:05:19.740 --> 00:05:20.360
Tokiko!

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:22.910
Ka...zuki...

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:25.600
Now! Pierce through!

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:29.310
Jousting Slasher!

00:05:30.820 --> 00:05:31.810
Tokiko!

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:35.620
Why'd you do such a thing?

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:39.150
He saw through our plan so l changed it.

00:05:39.620 --> 00:05:40.150
But!

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:53.840
Plus, this is probably the last chance l have to fight.

00:05:55.010 --> 00:05:57.130
lt's finally risen up to my spine.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:01.380
My body movements are gradually slowing down.

00:06:02.510 --> 00:06:06.780
l engineered this, thinking l must not miss, but...

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:09.890
You're a dangerous woman...

00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:14.150
That tenacity will absolutely spell disaster for my master

00:06:14.230 --> 00:06:16.490
even if you become a homunculus!

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:19.620
I'll bring you down here and now for certain!

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.430
lt seems one more blow is necessary.

00:06:26.040 --> 00:06:26.970
Leave the rest to me.

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:28.930
You rest, Tokiko.

00:06:29.770 --> 00:06:32.140
From here on...

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:36.780
I'll fight alone.

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:41.250
I'll beat this guy, catch Papillon,

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:44.850
destroy the twenty-first embryo and get the antidote.

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:48.150
lt's useless to act tough. l know.

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:50.420
lt's usually the one with inferior fighting strength

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:51.900
who bears the role of decoy.

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:58.960
l can take care of you later.
The girl is top priority.

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:03.270
Step aside, Kazuki!
You're still no match for him!

00:07:03.840 --> 00:07:04.640
Step aside!

00:07:05.010 --> 00:07:05.740
l won't!

00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:07.340
Step aside!

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:13.480
l won't step aside!

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:15.780
Even if it's your order, Tokiko.

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:18.490
l won't step aside no matter what!

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:36.870
There's an opening! Jousting Slasher!

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:41.540
No good! l missed again!

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:43.850
lt's useless no matter how often you attempt it!

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:46.440
l read the wind with my wing.

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:49.450
Rather than looking with my eyes or listening with my ears,

00:07:49.520 --> 00:07:51.850
the wind accurately tells me everything!

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:57.590
No matter what the situation, the defense of this wing will never fail!

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:02.130
<i>However, the wind has changed a bit.</i>

00:08:02.630 --> 00:08:07.700
<i>lnexperienced as always.</i>
<i>A far cry from a gale or a typhoon, but...</i>

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:10.340
<i>l'm sensing a powerful breath.</i>

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:13.940
<i>The source is...</i>

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:16.940
<i>This homunculus.</i>

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:19.650
<i>Even if he only has</i> <i>one arm or one wing,</i>

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:21.710
<i>his defense is</i> <i>as impregnable as ever.</i>

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:24.690
<i>Kazuki alone can't possibly...</i>

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:28.830
Tokiko, stay out of it!

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:31.060
Here l go!

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:37.300
That girl...

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:40.130
ls the girl that important?

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:41.030
Huh?

00:08:42.510 --> 00:08:45.440
ls it a hierarchal relationship coming from the discrepancy in power?

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:48.170
Or, are you two a couple?

00:08:48.510 --> 00:08:53.920
l owe Tokiko my life. l died once and she gave me new life!

00:08:55.150 --> 00:08:58.650
Her life is on the line now!
No way will l lose!

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:00.530
The same as me, huh...?

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:01.420
What?

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:04.920
l owe my life to my master.

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:11.430
Before getting this body, l was a wild hawk.

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:14.870
The greatest bird of prey and the king of the skies.

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:18.040
Out of them all, l was one of the strongest.

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:19.100
However...

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:26.450
By accident or poachers, l got shot and fell.

00:09:27.820 --> 00:09:29.120
Over too soon...

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:32.350
Well, this is what life is.

00:09:33.190 --> 00:09:34.960
Whether it's a protected species or not,

00:09:35.030 --> 00:09:37.460
once you're dead, bye-bye, and it's over.

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:42.730
But to think l'd come to catch butterflies and end up getting something so rare.

00:09:44.070 --> 00:09:46.160
You and l are both lucky.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:50.530
Rejoice. I'll bring you back to life.

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:53.840
And then, l came back to life.

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:57.140
l owe my life to my master.

00:09:57.420 --> 00:10:01.110
l'd died once and he gave me new life and power.

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:04.150
Now his life is on the line!

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:06.190
l won't allow...interference!

00:10:06.820 --> 00:10:07.810
<i>No wonder.</i>

00:10:08.130 --> 00:10:11.890
<i>The height of consciousness towards battle</i> <i>is a technique something wild can perform.</i>

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:15.930
l see. You and l are the same. But...

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:18.500
Our benefactors are totally different!

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:23.110
Chono only views you as guinea pigs.

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:25.800
He tramples upon the lives of others

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:29.540
and only thinks about himself escaping death and living on...

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:33.540
What Chono's doing is a mistake!
And thanks to that mistake...

00:10:33.620 --> 00:10:34.680
Ridiculous!

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:36.710
Kazuki!

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:40.190
Fearing death is the instinct of living beings.

00:10:40.590 --> 00:10:43.580
l who lived in the wild know this very well.

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:46.600
My master's actions are not mistaken!

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:50.660
Honestly, you don't want to die like this either, right?

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:53.960
lf you pledge never to have anything to do with my master again,

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:56.270
l could let things slide.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:11:01.110
lt's not shameful or evil to fear death and run away from it.

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:05.220
But if l run away,

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:07.710
there's someone who will be seized by death in my place.

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:11.280
No way will l step away!

00:11:11.890 --> 00:11:12.880
No way will l lose!

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:15.190
No way will l let Tokiko die!

00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:17.630
<i>He's wrapping the cloth</i> <i>around the tip of the spear!</i>

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:20.090
<i>ln that state, he can use</i> <i>the energy of the cloth</i>

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:23.860
<i>not just for charging power</i> <i>but for destructive power itself!</i>

00:11:24.340 --> 00:11:25.200
<i>But...</i>

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:29.640
You're right, l'm afraid of dying.

00:11:30.270 --> 00:11:32.210
l know that since l've died once.

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:35.180
And l know that Chono is confronting death as well.

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:38.010
But Chono and l are human.

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:41.220
So! There are things that must not be done,

00:11:41.290 --> 00:11:43.750
and things that must be done even if we die!

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:47.660
That'll inflict damage on himself, too!

00:11:48.130 --> 00:11:49.220
Stop, Kazuki!

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:51.120
Energy full blast!

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:55.970
Jousting Crasher!

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:13.380
The breeze has turned into a real wind, huh?

00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:24.050
l know it's selfish, but l have just one favor. My master...

00:12:27.230 --> 00:12:31.530
l won't kill him. l had no such intention from the start.

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:34.300
I'll just stop him.

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:39.980
l can die in peace, hearing that.

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:45.910
<i>l can die in peace, huh?</i>

00:12:46.880 --> 00:12:52.290
<i>l never knew there was such a death.</i>

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:59.990
<i>Although he said fearing death</i> <i>was the instinct of living beings,</i>

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:02.760
<i>he risked his life fighting for Papillon.</i>

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:07.030
<i>He was a peculiar homunculus</i> <i>until the very end,</i>

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:09.510
<i>but it turned out to be</i> <i>a good experience for Kazuki.</i>

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:14.640
<i>lt's truly uncommon to be able</i> <i>to use the Buso Renkin to this extent</i>

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:16.200
<i>in just one week.</i>

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:20.410
The fifth day ends.

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:26.080
One day left.
Time runs out tomorrow at midnight.

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:28.190
Are you okay, Tokiko?

00:13:28.860 --> 00:13:30.490
We'll climb down the mountain before the sun comes up.

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:34.690
There's no way in that condition.
We'll spend the night here.

00:13:35.570 --> 00:13:39.370
lt seems we've come quite a long way.

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:44.000
We'll rest for the night and heal using the power of the kakugane.

00:13:44.610 --> 00:13:47.550
Even if we go down the mountain tomorrow morning and take a train,

00:13:47.610 --> 00:13:50.140
we won't arrive in Ginsei City until past evening.

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:53.050
Then we'll look for Chono immediately after we arrive.

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:55.280
l've got a pretty good idea of his whereabouts.

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:58.850
Now that he's lost all of his homunculi,

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:01.620
he's nothing but a helpless high school student.

00:14:02.060 --> 00:14:05.050
His last hope is most likely his family home.

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:08.360
All right! Time runs out tomorrow night at twelve!

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:09.560
We'll make it in plenty of time!

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:15.300
That's right. So I'll leave all the rest to you and remain here.

00:14:16.810 --> 00:14:18.370
—What're you saying?
—Hey! Don't shake me!

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:20.600
—That doesn't make sense!
—We're in bad shape! Stop it...

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:28.280
Making it in time means you by yourself.

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:31.920
Thanks to this, my lower body's paralyzed and l can't move.

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:35.160
So l can't get down the mountain.

00:14:35.590 --> 00:14:37.620
But then l won't have time to come back

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:39.030
even if l do get the antidote!

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:42.330
lt's okay. lt's not necessary to come back.

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:47.360
Tomorrow morning, after l can no longer see you,

00:14:47.670 --> 00:14:50.300
I'll take care of myself.

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:53.640
—What're you giving up for?! Don't die!
—l told you not to shake me!

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:54.940
—There should still be a way!
—Both of us will die. Stop it!

00:14:58.380 --> 00:14:58.940
l know!

00:14:59.220 --> 00:15:01.880
You said you're on a mission, right?!

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:04.310
That means you've got friends, right?!

00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:10.020
lt's useless. All the warriors in Japan are on missions of their own.

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:13.530
Unfortunately, even if l were to ask for help,

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.860
it wouldn't come in time.

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:20.600
l think eventually there'll be some kind of action by the main unit,

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:23.160
but everything will come after the situation is resolved.

00:15:23.970 --> 00:15:26.940
After that, not too long after,

00:15:27.010 --> 00:15:31.450
the next warrior should appear before you, Kazuki.

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:34.480
After you report everything to that person,

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:36.450
tuck away everything that happened this week

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:38.850
into the depths of your memory.

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:42.960
lt suits you better to spend your days pleasantly

00:15:43.030 --> 00:15:45.020
with your little sister and your friends.

00:15:45.300 --> 00:15:47.360
This time for sure, go back to your daily life.

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:51.500
Okay, I'll go back.

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:52.660
That's how it should be.

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:53.800
But together.

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:56.160
Heey!

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:57.730
Don't be doing things your own way

00:15:57.810 --> 00:15:59.610
by taking advantage of someone who can't move!

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:02.370
We go down the mountain without waiting for daybreak!

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:04.470
Even the two of us can make it by evening somehow!

00:16:04.550 --> 00:16:05.880
lf you do such a reckless thing,

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:07.890
you'll run out of physical strength and collapse in a heap!

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:10.050
I'll be okay! You're light!

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:13.520
You moron! That's not the issue!
Let me down!

00:16:13.960 --> 00:16:17.450
Heck no! l said before that l don't want any more victims!

00:16:17.930 --> 00:16:20.090
You're one of them as well, Tokiko.

00:16:21.030 --> 00:16:21.760
We'll make it in time!

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.560
I'll show you that l can get us there in time!

00:16:26.800 --> 00:16:29.500
<i>His shoulders are much broader</i> <i>than they look.</i>

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:38.880
<i>Day Six</i>
<i>The damage from the gusty winds</i> <i>of unknown origin that occurred yesterday</i>

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:41.890
<i>at the Ginsei Academy dormitory</i> <i>in Ginsei City in Saitama Prefecture...</i>

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:44.950
Kazuki hasn't come back...

00:16:45.460 --> 00:16:50.390
He disappears a lot lately, but one full day is a bit overboard.

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:53.130
That's right. l smoothed things over at roll call yesterday

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:55.790
by changing my voice and that was fine for yesterday, but...

00:16:58.440 --> 00:16:59.870
Hi man, l'm Kazuki...

00:17:00.470 --> 00:17:01.670
You did such a thing?!

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:03.000
What <i>are</i> you?!

00:17:03.570 --> 00:17:08.810
Anyway, ever since that Tokiko showed up,
Kazuki's eccentric behavior has hit turbo!

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:11.980
Could it be that he's gotten involved in something dangerous?

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:13.340
lf that's the case...

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:15.050
<i>Big Brother...</i>

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:19.050
Big Brother!

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:19.820
Kazuki!

00:17:21.760 --> 00:17:23.020
l'm back.

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:27.090
Madly in love and all beaten up!

00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:31.130
What the heck happened?
Could it be that...

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:33.330
you were blown away by yesterday's gusty winds?!

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:34.530
Yeah! That!

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:38.470
And Tokiko is unable to move because of her chronic lower-back pain

00:17:38.540 --> 00:17:40.640
and l carried her here on my back the whole way.

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:41.880
The whole way?

00:17:42.050 --> 00:17:43.110
Yeah, the whole way.

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:47.790
Enough. Enough already.
Just let me die.

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:50.580
Negative thoughts are strictly prohibited! lt's still too soon to give up!

00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:54.790
That's right, Tokiko!
Lower-back pain gets better!

00:17:55.690 --> 00:17:58.290
<i>She's out of touch. Just what l'd expect</i> <i>from Kazuki's little sister.</i>

00:17:58.700 --> 00:17:59.760
Right-right...

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:02.320
Then, I'll be going now!

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:03.230
Huh?

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:05.990
Wait!
Are you going off somewhere again?

00:18:06.740 --> 00:18:09.330
Yeah. l've got some unfinished business.

00:18:09.710 --> 00:18:11.040
But you're all beat up.

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:13.010
You could rest tonight and go tomorrow or something.

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:15.210
No, it has to be tonight!

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:22.510
So Mahiro, l leave Tokiko to you while l'm gone!

00:18:22.590 --> 00:18:23.210
What?!

00:18:23.590 --> 00:18:25.520
Please! I'll be back soon, so!

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:27.420
Got it. Leave it to me!

00:18:27.490 --> 00:18:30.690
As a matter of fact, l'm a master of taking care of people!

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:34.290
<i>lt's Kazuki...</i>
<i>There's a female Kazuki here.</i>

00:18:34.830 --> 00:18:39.360
Wait, Kazuki.
Are you keeping something from us?

00:18:39.670 --> 00:18:41.970
Are you involved in something dangerous?

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:46.170
Sorry...

00:18:46.880 --> 00:18:51.040
Okakura. As you say, things are kind of messy right now.

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:55.620
But it'll all be resolved tonight!
So it'll be okay!

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:02.550
Even if you can't tell us about the situation,

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:04.650
l wanted to help you out.

00:19:05.130 --> 00:19:07.530
But there's no need to worry and there's no problem?

00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:09.400
Then go resolve things at once!

00:19:10.030 --> 00:19:10.800
Kazuki...

00:19:11.870 --> 00:19:13.240
What, Tokiko?

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:17.070
Your cell phone is no longer of any use to you from the battle last night,

00:19:17.140 --> 00:19:18.700
so take this with you.

00:19:20.280 --> 00:19:23.680
First, don't forget to report on the situation in detail.

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:25.480
And take this as well.

00:19:26.480 --> 00:19:28.210
lt won't go so far as double,

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:31.050
but the healing power will get stronger if you have two rather than one.

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:32.950
lf something bad should happen,

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:34.510
you can reduce the burden on your body

00:19:34.590 --> 00:19:38.360
if you apply one to the Buso Renkin and one to healing.

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:47.570
Kazuki, you are far better suited to being with your little sister and your friends.

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:51.270
So not just for my sake...

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:56.100
come back here for your own sake as well, no matter what!

00:19:56.180 --> 00:19:58.080
Roger! Definitely!

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:01.080
All right! One more run!

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:08.390
<i>Wait for me, Tokiko! Wait for me, guys!</i>

00:20:14.930 --> 00:20:17.490
Kazuki, it's useless talking to him.

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:19.920
No words can reach him.

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:22.960
Quickly, take the homunculus embryo away from him!

00:20:23.930 --> 00:20:26.130
Next time, "The Butterfly of Black Death"

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:28.360
I'll splatter your guts!

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:36.280
<i>Mahiro's Buso Renkin Seminar!</i>

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:41.010
Hello! This is Mahiro!

00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:45.550
Here's another round of awesome commentary on the Buso Renkin!

00:20:45.820 --> 00:20:49.320
For our second round of the Buso Renkin Seminar

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:53.260
for today, my commentary will be on...
Valkyrie Skirt!

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:55.890
Oh, before we get into that,

00:20:55.970 --> 00:20:59.770
you already know who wields the Valkyrie Skirt, right?

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:02.370
Her name is Tokiko Tsumura.

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:04.370
Yup! lt's Tokiko-san!

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:08.270
Tokiko-san was the person who gave new life to my big brother

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:10.310
after he was killed by the homunculus.

00:21:10.550 --> 00:21:13.380
She's so slender and smaller than l am,

00:21:13.450 --> 00:21:18.510
and yet she is a hardened alchemist warrior that defeats homunculi.

00:21:19.060 --> 00:21:20.620
Ever so cool,

00:21:20.690 --> 00:21:25.530
she always has harsh words for
Big Brother's silly remarks.

00:21:25.830 --> 00:21:27.920
lt's as though they're a husband-and-wife comedy routine!

00:21:28.170 --> 00:21:30.730
l'm so jealous of Big Brother getting all the attention!

00:21:31.070 --> 00:21:32.630
Oh, but wait!

00:21:32.700 --> 00:21:38.370
lf the two are a couple, then that makes Tokiko-san my big sister!

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:41.610
That means we can do things like that, and this, and....

00:21:41.680 --> 00:21:44.480
Oooh, what am l gonna do!

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:51.090
Hmmm? Oh, l'm sorry!
My imagination got carried away!

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:54.180
I'll continue with the rest once l get back to the dorms!

00:21:54.530 --> 00:21:56.650
Now, back to where we left off,

00:21:57.130 --> 00:22:02.360
Tokiko-san wields and controls the Deathscythe Buso Renkin, Valkyrie Skirt.

00:22:02.900 --> 00:22:06.030
Notice from the parts attached on her thighs,

00:22:06.100 --> 00:22:08.440
there are four long thingies sticking out?

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:11.970
The tip of each is made into a scythe that can cut very well.

00:22:12.280 --> 00:22:16.150
Using its manipulators for quick and precise movements,

00:22:16.210 --> 00:22:20.380
Tokiko-san can take out an army of enemies at once.

00:22:20.820 --> 00:22:25.050
Plus, the manipulators are commanded by directly carrying out the signals

00:22:25.120 --> 00:22:28.290
from the bioelectricity flowing through the nerves.

00:22:28.460 --> 00:22:32.760
That's why in order to relay messages more precisely, and more quickly,

00:22:32.830 --> 00:22:35.530
Tokiko-san attaches them directly onto her skin.

00:22:36.130 --> 00:22:39.330
Though cool and anti-social when we first met,

00:22:39.400 --> 00:22:41.630
Tokiko-san is now part of our group!

00:22:42.110 --> 00:22:45.630
She's the cool big sister who has a repartee for everyone!

00:22:46.010 --> 00:22:49.210
Please take good care of my big brother, Tokiko-san!

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:52.240
Okie dokie, tune in next time!

00:22:55.120 --> 00:22:58.680
Mahiro Illustration by: Taeko Hori

00:22:59.460 --> 00:23:03.660
Nobuhiro Watsuki / SHUEISHA,
Busorenkin Project
